{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "batch_norm_inference",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_mean",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_var",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, H, W]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "按通道对输入 x 执行 BatchNorm2d 推理：对每个通道 c，y[n,c,h,w] = (x[n,c,h,w] - running_mean[c]) / sqrt(running_var[c] + eps) * weight[c] + bias[c]。",
        "若 weight/bias 为 None，则对应缩放/偏移省略，与参考模块一致。",
        "返回与 x 同 shape 的新张量，float32、CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "group_norm_inference",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "num_groups",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, H, W]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "将通道分为 num_groups 组，在每组内对每个样本的空间元素归一化：对样本 n 的组 g，计算该组所有通道的均值/方差，然后 y[n,c,h,w] = (x[n,c,h,w] - mean[n,g]) / sqrt(var[n,g] + eps) * weight[c] + bias[c]。",
        "均值和方差使用有偏估计（除以元素个数），与 nn.GroupNorm 一致。",
        "返回与 x 同 shape 的新张量，float32、CUDA。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.batch_norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "执行 BatchNorm2d 推理路径：使用 running_mean/running_var 做通道归一化，应用 affine weight/bias（若存在），输出 shape [16,3,512,512]。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.group_norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 BatchNorm 输出执行 GroupNorm 推理：num_groups=3、num_channels=3，因此每组仅一个通道，归一化等价于逐通道的实例归一化（对每个样本每个通道的空间位置求均值和方差），应用 affine weight/bias，输出 shape [16,3,512,512]。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回 GroupNorm 输出作为模型最终结果，Tensor[16,3,512,512]，float32，CUDA。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}